250">wildest </span><span begin="00:22.250" end="00:22.640">night</span><span begin="00:22.640" end="00:22.640">, </span><span begin="00:22.640" end="00:22.760">I </span><span begin="00:22.760" end="00:23.450">became </span><span begin="00:23.450" end="00:23.660">the </span><span begin="00:23.660" end="00:26.120">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.570" end="00:30.350"><span begin="00:26.570" end="00:26.720">And </span><span begin="00:26.720" end="00:26.870">you'll </span><span begin="00:26.870" end="00:27.170">know </span><span begin="00:27.170" end="00:27.500">you're </span><span begin="00:27.500" end="00:27.950">mine </span><span begin="00:27.950" end="00:28.100">when </span><span begin="00:28.100" end="00:28.190">the </span><span begin="00:28.190" end="00:29.150">silence </span><span begin="00:29.150" end="00:30.350">comes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.120" end="00:42.980"><span begin="00:32.120" end="00:35.960">Heavy </span><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:36.290">is </span><span begin="00:36.290" end="00:37.400">the </span><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:40.190">crown </span><span begin="00:40.190" end="00:40.700">only </span><span begin="00:40.700" end="00:41.000">for </span><span begin="00:41.000" end="00:42.200">the </span><span begin="00:42.200" end="00:42.980">weak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.970" end="00:48.980"><span begin="00:43.970" end="00:44.150">The </span><span begin="00:44.150" end="00:44.780">knife </span><span begin="00:44.780" end="00:45.020">in </span><span begin="00:45.020" end="00:45.380">my </span><span begin="00:45.380" end="00:46.880">heart </span><span begin="00:46.880" end="00:47.300">couldn't </span><span begin="00:47.300" end="00:47.630">slow </span><span begin="00:47.630" end="00:48.260">me </span><span begin="00:48.260" end="00:48.980">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.010" end="00:53.600"><span begin="00:49.010" end="00:49.400">'Cause </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.940">power </span><span begin="00:49.940" end="00:50.210">is </span><span begin="00:50.210" end="00:51.020">power</span><span begin="00:51.020" end="00:51.320">, </span><span begin="00:51.320" end="00:51.530">the </span><span begin="00:51.530" end="00:52.010">fire </span><span begin="00:52.010" end="00:52.520">never </span><span begin="00:52.520" end="00:53.150">goes </span><span begin="00:53.150" end="00:53.600">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.680" end="00:59.660"><span begin="00:54.680" end="00:54.860">I </span><span begin="00:54.860" end="00:55.370">rise </span><span begin="00:55.370" end="00:55.700">from </span><span begin="00:55.700" end="00:56.000">my </span><span begin="00:56.000" end="00:57.500">scars</span><span begin="00:57.500" end="00:57.530">, </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:58.010">nothing </span><span begin="00:58.010" end="00:58.400">hurts </span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.910">me </span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.660">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.810" end="01:01.850"><span begin="00:59.810" end="01:00.080">'Cause </span><span begin="01:00.080" end="01:00.590">power </span><span begin="01:00.590" end="01:00.890">is </span><span begin="01:00.890" end="01:01.850">power</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.030" end="01:05.000"><span begin="01:02.030" end="01:02.300">Now </span><span begin="01:02.300" end="01:02.570">watch </span><span begin="01:02.570" end="01:02.840">me </span><span begin="01:02.840" end="01:03.470">burn </span><span begin="01:03.470" end="01:03.890">it </span><span begin="01:03.890" end="01:05.000">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.900" end="01:18.800"><span begin="01:14.900" end="01:15.260">I </span><span begin="01:15.260" end="01:15.560">went </span><span begin="01:15.560" end="01:15.920">down </span><span begin="01:15.920" end="01:16.040">for </span><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.190">the </span><span begin="01:16.190" end="01:17.270">coldest </span><span begin="01:17.270" end="01:18.800">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.580" end="01:24.590"><span begin="01:19.580" end="01:20.000">And </span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.120">I </span><span begin="01:20.120" end="01:20.570">know </span><span begin="01:20.570" end="01:20.930">well </span><span begin="01:20.930" end="01:21.470">because </span><span begin="01:21.470" end="01:21.560">I </span><span begin="01:21.560" end="01:22.100">played </span><span begin="01:22.100" end="01:23.450">before</span><span begin="01:23.450" end="01:23.840">, </span><span begin="01:23.840" end="01:24.590">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.830" end="01:27.440"><span begin="01:24.830" end="01:25.130">I </span><span begin="01:25.130" end="01:25.370">don't </span><span begin="01:25.370" end="01:25.940">know </span><span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.180">with </span><span begin="01:26.180" end="01:26.510">whatever </span><span begin="01:26.510" end="01:26.780">you </span><span begin="01:26.780" end="01:27.440">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.620" end="01:30.080"><span begin="01:27.620" end="01:27.800">I </span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:28.070">don't </span><span begin="01:28.070" end="01:28.640">know </span><span begin="01:28.640" end="01:28.760">if </span><span begin="01:28.760" end="01:28.940">we </span><span begin="01:28.940" end="01:29.150">need </span><span begin="01:29.150" end="01:29.240">it </span><span begin="01:29.240" end="01:29.570">your </span><span begin="01:29.570" end="01:30.080">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.230" end="01:32.570"><span begin="01:30.230" end="01:30.350">You </span><span begin="01:30.350" end="01:30.770">wanna </span><span begin="01:30.770" end="01:31.250">take </span><span begin="01:31.250" end="01:31.400">my </span><span begin="01:31.400" end="01:31.910">place </span><span begin="01:31.910" end="01:32.090">from </span><span begin="01:32.090" end="01:32.570">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.570" end="01:35.570"><span begin="01:32.570" end="01:33.260">Away</span><span begin="01:33.260" end="01:33.260">, </span><span begin="01:33.260" end="01:33.500">as </span><span begin="01:33.500" end="01:33.920">I'm </span><span begin="01:33.920" end="01:34.310">lookin' </span><span begin="01:34.310" end="01:34.460">up </span><span begin="01:34.460" end="01:34.550">at </span><span begin="01:34.550" end="01:34.910">your </span><span begin="01:34.910" end="01:35.570">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.600" end="01:40.790"><span begin="01:35.600" end="01:35.930">How </span><span begin="01:35.930" end="01:36.200">could </span><span begin="01:36.200" end="01:36.380">I </span><span begin="01:36.380" end="01:37.040">ever </span><span begin="01:37.040" end="01:39.110">know</span><span begin="01:39.110" end="01:39.530">? </span><span begin="01:39.530" end="01:39.800">Who </span><span begin="01:39.800" end="01:40.070">can </span><span begin="01:40.070" end="01:40.220">I </span><span begin="01:40.220" end="01:40.760">trust</span><span begin="01:40.760" end="01:40.790">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.790" end="01:43.850"><span begin="01:40.790" end="01:41.480">Feelings </span><span begin="01:41.480" end="01:41.660">of </span><span begin="01:41.660" end="01:43.850">emptiness</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.180" end="01:47.780"><span begin="01:44.180" end="01:44.750">Only </span><span begin="01:44.750" end="01:45.020">love </span><span begin="01:45.020" end="01:45.350">could </span><span begin="01:45.350" end="01:45.920">kill </span><span begin="01:45.920" end="01:46.160">me</span><span begin="01:46.160" end="01:46.160">, </span><span begin="01:46.160" end="01:46.580">God </span><span begin="01:46.580" end="01:47.780">bless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.990" end="01:50.840"><span begin="01:47.990" end="01:48.140">The </span><span begin="01:48.140" end="01:48.800">knife </span><span begin="01:48.800" end="01:49.010">in </span><span begin="01:49.010" end="01:49.370">my </span><span begin="01:49.370" end="01:50.840">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.870" end="01:53.240"><span begin="01:50.870" end="01:51.107">Couldn't </span><span begin="01:51.107" end="01:51.344">slow </span><span begin="01:51.344" end="01:51.581">me </span><span begin="01:51.581" end="01:51.818">down </span><span begin="01:51.818" end="01:52.055">（</span><span begin="01:52.055" end="01:52.292">Couldn't </span><span begin="01:52.292" end="01:52.529">slow </span><span begin="01:52.529" end="01:52.766">me </span><span begin="01:52.766" end="01:53.003">down</span><span begin="01:53.003" end="01:53.240">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.240" end="01:55.400"><span begin="01:53.240" end="01:53.390">'Cause </span><span begin="01:53.390" end="01:53.930">power </span><span begin="01:53.930" end="01:54.200">is </span><span begin="01:54.200" end="01:54.950">power </span><span begin="01:54.950" end="01:54.950">（</span><span begin="01:54.950" end="01:55.040">'Cause </span><span begin="01:55.040" end="01:55.250">power </span><span begin="01:55.250" end="01:55.310">is </span><span begin="01:55.310" end="01:55.400">power</span><span begin="01:55.400" end="01:55.400">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.400" end="01:58.250"><span begin="01:55.400" end="01:55.520">The </span><span begin="01:55.520" end="01:56.060">fire </span><span begin="01:56.060" end="01:56.540">never </span><span begin="01:56.540" end="01:57.140">goes </span><span begin="01:57.140" end="01:58.250">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.670" end="02:01.490"><span begin="01:58.670" end="01:58.850">I </span><span begin="01:58.850" end="01:59.390">rise </span><span begin="01:59.390" end="01:59.690">from </span><span begin="01:59.690" end="01:59.990">my </span><span begin="01:59.990" end="02:01.490">scars</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.520" end="02:03.890"><span begin="02:01.520" end="02:02.030">Nothing </span><span begin="02:02.030" end="02:02.420">hurts </spa